OL,4,BWomen's Six Nations 2024: Guide to the 
OL,5,Bteams as England seek to retain title  
OL,6, Last year saw yet more Women's Six     
OL,7, Nations records tumble, but ultimately 
OL,8, England lifted the trophy at Twickenham
OL,9, in the spring sunshine.                
OL,11,FNo other country has touched the       
OL,12,Fsilverware since France in 2018, and   
OL,13,Fthere is no disguising the fact that   
OL,14,Fthe Red Roses and Les Bleues are       
OL,15,Fexpected to lead the way once again.   
OL,17,FHowever, the precious commodity of     
OL,18,FWorld Cup 2025 qualification for the   
OL,19,Fnext-highest ranked side gives other   
OL,20,Fteams something extra to fight for.    
